{"suttaId":"sn27.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[1206,1206],"vripara":"329"},"segments":{"sn27.8:0.3":"Taṇhāsuttaṃ","sn27.8:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn27.8:1.2":"“Yo, bhikkhave, rūpataṇhāya chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.8:1.3":"Yo saddataṇhāya … yo gandhataṇhāya … yo rasataṇhāya … yo phoṭṭhabbataṇhāya … yo dhammataṇhāya chandarāgo, cittasseso upakkileso.","sn27.8:1.8":"Yato kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhuno … pe … abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū”ti.","sn27.8:1.10":"Aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":455,"to":458,"paras":[{"para":455,"vripara":"322-331","refs":["sn27.8:1"],"lines":["322-331. Kilesasaṃyutte <b>cittasseso upakkileso</b>ti kataracittassa?","Catubhūmakacittassa.","Tebhūmakacittassa tāva hotu, lokuttarassa kathaṃ upakkileso hotīti?","Uppattinivāraṇato.","So hi tassa uppajjituṃ appadānena upakkilesoti veditabbo.","<b>Nekkhammaninnan</b>ti navalokuttaradhammaninnaṃ.","<b>Cittan</b>ti samathavipassanācittaṃ.","<b>Abhiññā sacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesū</b>ti paccavekkhaṇañāṇena abhijānitvā sacchikātabbesu chaḷabhiññādhammesu, ekaṃ dhammaṃ vā gaṇhantena nekkhammanti gahetabbaṃ.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"]]},{"para":456,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kilesasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":457,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sāriputtasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":458,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn27.8:1"],"lines":["1-9. Vivekajasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn27.8:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":479,"to":482,"paras":[{"para":479,"vripara":"322-331","refs":["sn27.8:1"],"lines":["322-331. <b>Eso</b>ti cakkhusmiṃ chandarāgo.","Upecca kilesetīti <b>upakkileso.</b>","<b>Cittassā</b>ti sāmaññavacanaṃ anicchanto codako <b>“kataracittassā”</b>ti āha.","Itaro kāmaṃ upatāpanamalīnabhāvakaraṇavasena upakkileso lokuttarassa natthi, vibādhanaṭṭho pana attheva uppattinivāraṇatoti adhippāyenāha <b>“catubhūmakacittassā”</b>ti.","Codako <b>“tebhūmakā”</b>tiādinā attano adhippāyaṃ vivarati, itaro <b>“uppattinivāraṇato”</b>tiādinā.","Ariyaphalapaṭippassaddhipahānavasena pavattiyā sabbasaṃkilesato nikkhantattā nekkhammaṃ, magganibbānānaṃ pana nekkhammabhāvo ukkaṃsato gahito evāti āha <b>“nekkhammaninnanti navalokuttaradhammaninnan”</b>ti.","<b>Abhijānitvā</b>ti abhimukhabhāvena jānitvā.","<b>Sacchikātabbesū</b>ti paccakkhakātabbesu.","<b>Chaḷabhiññādhammesū</b>ti ariyamaggasampayuttadhammesu."],"lineRefs":[["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"],["sn27.8:1"]]},{"para":480,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kilesasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":481,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sāriputtasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":482,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn27.8:1"],"lines":["1-9. Vivekajasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn27.8:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
